editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-007/AUTHOR-REPORT.md:162:- **Karis's count:** the Ring's figure had had her thumb over it for twelve days; "the cup was under it" and "the cup and the bowl together were over it". The hook with two bars is "close" on two walls, so wide was only the ninth stone. Forty-one at both, "in the courses here", with no forty-second and none wanting; the line between the courses stands outside that count. She had been over the Fallow's eleven strips for four days at a trestle in a barn.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/editions/eleven-v4-directors-cut/chapters/chapter-46.txt:281:He knew what would be done with it. The code let a seat proceed upon its own authority where a certificate was withheld; he had cited that section himself, once, long ago, when a guild hall's assessor would not sign. His line would stop nothing. The sittings would sit, and the ruling would be read, and somewhere in a minute a clerk would enter that a thing usually present was not there. That was the whole of what he could do, and he had weighed it on a post road for four days and found that it was still worth doing.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-006/pre-repair/chapter-40.md:285:"It's been off the tree longer than any apple on that shelf. That brown you're so fond of came down a fortnight after it, and it'll be meal before the snow's a week old." He had turned, and was reaching up to a shelf over the hearth, into the dark behind a row of crocks; and what he brought down was green, and long, and wrinkled like an old woman's knuckle. "That's the same tree as your sour one, and it's last year's. Go on."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-006/pre-repair-r1/chapter-38.md:285:He knew that beat. He had tried for four days down a mountain to walk at a healer's pace, and had failed, since he went in fits, as he had always gone.
