editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-005/review-editorial.stdout.log:5551:- (e) The Seln circuit is walked on days 48 (post sort) and 49 (lodge), and the four queries, Hesk's letter, the inventory and Withrow's story all fall on day 49, so the inventory is named inside its sixth week. The source's "four days" between the queries and Hesk's letter became two hours.
