editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-001/recheck-r1.stdout.log:4140:"There is a margin. A margin belongs to the officer who takes the paper, and I have been thirteen years learning what one is for." Bracken laid the pen down. "Somebody will open this, some year. He will see a challenge, and a ruling, and a withdrawal inside the same week, and he will ask himself the natural question, which is whether the house put you out to save itself. He will be a careful man, I hope, and I should like him to find that the registrar was there, and looked at the clock, and wrote down what he saw." He paused. "The chancellor knew of this door four days before you did, and she did not say one word to you about it. I know what that cost, for I was the one she did not send. It ought to be written somewhere that nobody pushed."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-001/recheck-r1.stdout.log:4478:"There is a margin. A margin belongs to the officer who takes the paper, and I have been thirteen years learning what one is for." Bracken laid the pen down. "Somebody will open this, some year. He will see a challenge, and a ruling, and a withdrawal inside the same week, and he will ask himself the natural question, which is whether the house put you out to save itself. He will be a careful man, I hope, and I should like him to find that the registrar was there, and looked at the clock, and wrote down what he saw." He paused. "The chancellor knew of this door four days before you did, and she did not say one word to you about it. I know what that cost, for I was the one she did not send. It ought to be written somewhere that nobody pushed."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-001/recheck-r1.stdout.log:5261:He was not anywhere. A watcher's line had him on the east road, four days out, with a cart, and there was no line after that. Beyond the last station no district ran, and a restriction must run in a district; it wanted a counter to be served at, and a book to be written in. The code had foreseen that, as it foresaw most things. The clerk found the phrase in a schedule and wrote it at the instrument's foot.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-001/recheck-r1.stdout.log:5403:"That's four days of a man at my back."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-001/recheck-r1.stdout.log:5768:*By charter of the registry, this house being chartered: TIER VERIFICATION available at the district station, Ostrand, four days west. No station lies east of the river crossing, and the station at the ford is unstaffed. TRAVEL ENDORSEMENTS may be lodged at this house for forward transmission; allow twenty days. ENROLLMENT INQUIRIES by the same. The chartered rates of this house are posted within. Complaints of a chartered house lie to the district seat.*
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-001/recheck-r1.stdout.log:5824:The grey rider had come up closer than he had been in four days, perhaps eighty yards off. He was mounted again, and he rode up the last of the rise at a walk, and stopped at the pillar's foot on its western side, with the cob's nose level with the stone. He did not come past it.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-001/recheck-r1.stdout.log:5832:He looked at each of them in turn, as the elder coat had done at the road's foot, and at Seln a little longer than the rest, and his face did not change. It was a plain weathered face. He had stood by a milestone with a tin cup through a recess and eleven sittings, and he had ridden four days at their backs without once pretending to be anything else.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-001/recheck-r1.stdout.log:6444:He did not ask anybody. He went round the foot of the block, where the pine had been dropping dead limbs for longer than there had been a road, and gathered them up, and broke them across his knee and laid them small to large. He was quicker at it than he had been four days ago, and he had the fire's place chosen, in the lee of the stone, before the gelding was out of the shafts.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-001/recheck-r1.stdout.log:7264:   113	There were eight more. One wanted a night-watch kept on the landing, and one wanted stones picked out of a field, and one was a message to be walked to a hold four days off, for a mark and feed. Most were in the same square black hand, as if one person had written them out for others; but beside the words on each somebody had drawn a little picture, a wheel or a fence or a boat with sticks standing in it, for the use of people who could make nothing of the words.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-001/recheck-r1.stdout.log:9080:   355	He had no word to give them, for a man did not speak to a bottom line that had cost him nothing. If they were what four lines said, then the board would put them across his road before the snow, and there would be something to say then, and something to price.
