editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-005/source-tracking.stdout.log:1120:     3	The escort order's forensics took Seln four days, and he conducted them the way he conducted everything, in the margins of a working week, invisibly, from the service side, and what they returned was the last input the fifteen-year audit required.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-005/source-tracking.stdout.log:1442:     5	The note came up from the assessment office at the seventh bell, on the counter's ordinary stock, in the counter's ordinary hand, addressed to the delegation's floor coordinator and copied nowhere: *Wing three practice allocation revised. Enrollee's supervised hours suspended four days pending recovery-of-form. Reallocation to follow.* It was a true document about a true thing and it said nothing whatever, and Cael read it lying flat on his back on the residence floor with his boots still on, because the floor was the only surface in the room that had stopped moving, and thought, with the part of him that was still able to draft sentences, that the man had built a postponement out of a scheduling instrument in under an hour and had probably not thought of it as difficult.
