editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-008/pre-repair/chapter-49.md:213:That was the whole of it. Five words had gone out from a desk by a noon dispatch, after a man had weighed them for four days on a post road and found them worth sending though they would stop nothing. They had stopped nothing. They were in the minute as an absence, between the count of the exhibits and the count of the orders, and the clerk was already reading the next line.
