editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-003/recheck-r1.stdout.log:7454:editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-006.md:53:Dawn on the 111th: Oryn north on a route seventeen days late at Oxhollow, carrying a spare rope; the crew with her mule, three boxes and a hundred and two in hand. A rule on the page and a debt with a date. Ten fragments and one place that doesn't move. "Pike said nobody goes in twice. Tomorrow makes three." The completion report has been on a desk somewhere for eight days.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-003/recheck-r1.stdout.log:7472:editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-008.md:9:- POV: Cael ≈29,900. **Teague cutaway ≈1,700** (days 117–120: following the crew's trail three days along a bearing he does not understand, the healer brought because a shoulder was mended once; sitting down beside the boy; the column). **Karis cutaway ≈2,000** (days 119–120 at the far fire: three copies, the ledger, the edge laid and moved; it ends exactly on the pencil stopping; no who or why). **Seln cutaway ≈1,600** (days 124–128, the road home: the ledger in his coat; giving it to Karis and not asking for it back). **Oryn cutaway ≈2,800** (day 122 to about 128: the gap north-west, four days, three weeks late; Thornwater; the old woman's knee; writing the letter, ending on its four lines).
