editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/recheck-r2.stdout.log:1149:- **Vastin:** the refusal he rewrote with a citation is to a guild hall (not a station); a pinned slip asks who filled the five chairs in four days; the junior's thank-you note is on the copy in *held*; he visited the house's frame shop; the finding's last paragraph was read aloud once to the empty room.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/recheck-r2.stdout.log:1493:The four days ran on the office's ordinary clock. The certification dispute from the coastal district was resolved by a two-line advisory. The stations-office staffing note was annotated and returned. On the third day a junior evaluator from the northern district came up to the corner office with a difficult file — a Kindling record that did not match its practitioner's demonstrated architecture by a margin the junior found troubling — and Vastin reviewed it with him for an hour, patiently, the way he had reviewed such files for thirty years: the architecture was within tolerance; the record was sound; the margin was the ordinary variance of a young practitioner developing faster than his evaluators expected; continue observation. The junior thanked him and went down, reassured. Vastin sat afterward with the file's copy for longer than the file warranted, and could not have said why, and entered the not-saying in no ledger, because it was not yet a thing with a shape.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/recheck-r2.stdout.log:1503:The denial arrived in four days.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/recheck-r2.stdout.log:1610:*Nobody is buying the answer,* he wrote. *There isn't one for sale. They're buying the asking. That's a market that doesn't close when the ruling comes down, and the men who own the presses know it, which is why the series that started in the spring is still running in the winter. Whatever the seat decides, it will be printed within four days, at a half-copper, beside a woodcut of a boy who isn't me.*
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/recheck-r2.stdout.log:1805:The fifth arrived four days later, in the ordinary post, in a hand the delegation knew.
