editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-20.md:81:"No. Every account of them is careful to say so in its first line. He reads how a thing is built. He does not read what it says."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-20.md:223:"No. Round."
