editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/movement-004/pre-repair-r1/chapter-22.md:69:He had come back inside a Compact wall for the first time since he walked down a bluff with a house's certificate in his coat; and he had come as the fifth part of a movement of a stranger's thumb. Nobody had asked what he was. No pen had been lifted. He went on up the paved slope beyond the arch with his box on his shoulders, and his heart going as it had gone on the lip of a cut, and found that he could not have said whether he was relieved or insulted.
