+# TARGETED RECHECK r1 — Movement 4 (chapters 20–26)
+
+## VERDICT: CLOSE WITH LINE FIXES
+
+The repair is substantively successful. Vastin's Ostrand refusal remains the true causal reason; both tracked chapter-26 passages have been recomposed; the restored units, continuity, exit state, formula gates, source-overlap gate, and Reader Standard all hold. One punctuation-only broken dialogue join remains at chapter 21:197. The exact fix is below. It changes no words, touches no protected unit, and cannot create a new source-word run.
